# Fichiers et dossiers à ignorer lors de la construction Docker

# Build artifacts
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/logs/
**/TestResults/

# Coverage reports
CoverageReport/
CoverageReportFiltered/
CoverageReportFiltered_NoClient/

# IDE files
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# Docker files (pour éviter la récursion)
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*
.dockerignore

# Git
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# Documentation
README.md
*.md

# Package managers
**/packages/
**/node_modules/
**/.npm
**/.nuget/

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# Temporary files
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
*~

# Application specific
appsettings.local.json
appsettings.*.local.json

# Scripts
*.ps1
*.bat
*.sh